            @"Sign Spotify again with the bundle id set to\n\n%@\n\nIn Feather that is the Identifier field; leave PPQ protection off, it appends a random string and breaks this again.\n\nWhy: this build is installed as %@ but signed under the App ID %@. iOS opens the now playing card by the App ID, so it asks for an app that is not there. Nothing else in the mod is affected.": @"请重新签名 Spotify，并将应用标识符（Bundle ID）设为：\n\n%@\n\n在 Feather 中，这对应 Identifier 字段。请关闭 PPQ protection，它会附加随机字符串，导致问题再次出现。\n\n原因：此版本安装时使用的标识符为 %@，但签名中的 App ID 为 %@。iOS 会使用 App ID 打开正在播放卡片，因此找不到对应应用。模组的其他功能不受影响。",
